  Note: 'Audit trail for the customer-facing digital receipt (WhatsApp link to
/r/[orderId]) — one row per send attempt, whether it succeeded or not.
Lets order history show "already sent"/"failed" instead of a bare button,
and lets a merchant retry a FAILED send. See send-customer-receipt.ts.'
}

